keywords:
  - ai-security
  - prompt-injection
  - llm-agents
  - confused-deputy
  - reference-monitor
  - integrity-labels
  - agentdojo
abstract: >-
  Code, data and experiment scripts for a deterministic control plane for LLM agents: a policy
  enforcement point that mediates every tool call with a provenance rule on designators and a tiered
  approval rule, with no model on the decision path; its evaluation on AgentDojo; a model-free replay
  of all 949 reference trajectories; and an incident dataset of 80 publicly documented events coded
  under a written codebook.
